            "text": "<h2>Send Baked Goods Nationwide From Charlotte's Sunflour</h2>\n<p>Sunflour Baking Company has been baking from scratch in Charlotte, NC since 2009. Everything in this collection ships nationwide: real baked goods, made by real bakers, in small batches without mixes or shortcuts.</p>\n<p>The range covers whatever you need. <a href=\"/collections/cake-jars\">Cake jars</a> for the person who deserves something genuinely special. <a href=\"/collections/cookie-gifts\">Cookie gift boxes</a> for the office or a full spread. Brownie gifts for the chocolate lover. <a href=\"/collections/pastry-pouch\">Pastry pouches</a> for a quick, thoughtful individual send. Sampler boxes when you want to cover the full spread. Everything arrives in packaging that feels like a gift.</p>\n<h3>From-Scratch Baking Built to Ship</h3>\n<p>Most bakery gifts have a shipping problem: they arrive stale, dry, or crushed. We have spent years solving that. Insulated packaging, careful sealing, and intentional box design keep scratch-made baked goods fresh and intact through the journey. What your recipient opens is what left our oven.</p>\n<p>Everything in this collection is baked fresh to order in small batches, without artificial preservatives. Shelf life runs seven to ten days for most items, which is exactly what you should expect from real baked goods made without shortcuts.</p>\n<h3>Five Charlotte Locations for Local Pickup</h3>\n<p>If you are local to Charlotte, you can pick up at any of our five locations: Elizabeth, Dilworth, Ballantyne, Harrisburg, and NoDa. Same baked goods, no shipping wait. A good option for same-day gifts or building your own assortment in person.</p>"
